{
 "lines": [
  {
   "start": 0.52,
   "end": 3.2,
   "text": "If you're not using cloud right now, you're probably falling behind."
  },
  {
   "start": 3.52,
   "end": 6.6,
   "text": "The creator of cloud even said that AI is about to create a wealth gap bigger than anything"
  },
  {
   "start": 6.6,
   "end": 7.66,
   "text": "we've ever seen before."
  },
  {
   "start": 9.48,
   "end": 12.22,
   "text": "And don't worry, it's not too late to catch up, because here are the exact resources"
  },
  {
   "start": 12.22,
   "end": 13.32,
   "text": "to not get left behind."
  },
  {
   "start": 13.96,
   "end": 15.58,
   "text": "First is Anthopics free course library."
  },
  {
   "start": 16.24,
   "end": 19.28,
   "text": "They basically made free classes to teach you how to use their own AI, so there's"
  },
  {
   "start": 19.28,
   "end": 20.32,
   "text": "no reason not to learn."
  },
  {
   "start": 21.1,
   "end": 22.74,
   "text": "Next is Anthopics official skills plugins."
  },
  {
   "start": 23.22,
   "end": 25.8,
   "text": "These are basically cheat codes you can plug into cloud code to make it instantly"
  },
  {
   "start": 25.8,
   "end": 26.94,
   "text": "better at specific tasks."
  },
  {
   "start": 27.7,
   "end": 29.94,
   "text": "Finally, there's this repo called Awesome Cloud Code Subagents."
  },
  {
   "start": 30.56,
   "end": 33.4,
   "text": "This is a free collection of over 100 cloud code helpers built by the community."
  },
  {
   "start": 34.98,
   "end": 37.42,
   "text": "Think of them like apps you can add to cloud to make it do more things."
  },
  {
   "start": 38.94,
   "end": 40.76,
   "text": "And you do not want to be left behind when it comes to AI."
  },
  {
   "start": 42.3,
   "end": 44.36,
   "text": "And you do not want to be left behind when it comes to AI."
  },
  {
   "start": 44.64,
   "end": 46.32,
   "text": "And cloud is arguably the best AI right now."
  },
  {
   "start": 46.6,
   "end": 48.46,
   "text": "Follow and comment cloud for all the links I mentioned."
  }
 ],
